WEBVTT

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:02.500
To the rhythm!

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:05.810
Check it!

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:10.750
OK, fellas!

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:30.110
Yeah yeah party people
let's go let's turn it up

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:33.980
Let's rush in let's send it flying
let's attack let's dash

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:37.650
The battlefields are sacred,
Bakuretsu Tenshi, Crazy Burst Angel

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:41.210
They're a bother, they're cheeky,
come on, blast 'em good!

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:46.720
Everybody, loosey

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:50.430
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:53.760
Vividly, crazy

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:56.270
Fly up, angel

00:00:56.270 --> 00:00:58.570
We are the risma so charisma

00:00:58.570 --> 00:01:00.670
We soar, really prisma (bomber)

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:03.140
Hey! It's danceable OK
shake it right now let's go

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:05.940
Gutsiness let's go beat
let's ride the rhythm tension

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:07.580
It goes flying frustration

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:11.680
Alright let's go let's get it on
loosey beauty get your body

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:15.190
Everybody, loosey

00:01:15.190 --> 00:01:18.690
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:22.090
Vividly, crazy

00:01:22.090 --> 00:01:25.290
Fly up, angel

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:40.510
Starting today, this town belongs to me!

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:44.880
--What kind of joke is this?!
--It's no joke! It's for real!

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:50.650
I am the new law in this town!
Dissenters will get no mercy!

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:55.230
Oh, and this white doll-thingy...
It's an eyesore.

00:01:55.230 --> 00:01:58.160
Try using it again and I'll kill her!

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:03.270
With Meg kidnapped, we can't
make any careless moves.

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:05.540
All that's left is you!

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:09.170
Too bad they make you toil
for such little pay!

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:12.380
Why? Why did you betray us?!

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:15.980
Incompetent morons
like you disgusted me!

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:20.540
You were all pathetic losers
who clung only to your titles!

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:30.590
They caused a few terrorist
incidents in Osaka

00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:33.300
to show the ineptness
of the Hanshin Police,

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:36.030
and then took up the issue in the Diet.

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:39.540
The government's the wirepuller
behind the terrorist attacks?

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:46.140
That's right. I think they promised
Detective Iriki reign over Osaka.

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:50.380
But even in the center,
there's another hidden party involved!

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:54.320
All the guys that Jo's fought
have had advanced technology,

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:56.390
so it must be a big organization...

00:02:56.390 --> 00:03:00.090
Amy. Can you locate their hideout?

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:02.890
There was an underground
cybot factory beneath

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:05.930
where that truck was stopped.

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:10.430
As expected, a glowing brain
was used as its control.

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:14.370
As it was quite large,
it was probably from that monster.

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:21.780
I had Bailan check into it,
but apparently there's not a trace left.

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:26.120
And they've also used a strong
EM signal to create a magnetic storm...

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:29.850
Unless we're right behind them,
there's no way to tell where they are.

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:32.860
At least do something
about that, you dimwit!

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:39.130
That's mean! I am not a dimwit!
I can even read hard <i>kanji</i>!

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:42.470
Jinno-<i>san</i>. I'd like Django
to be ready to go at once.

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:45.970
I strengthened its equipment
for just such an occasion,

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:48.400
but with its pilot like this...

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:50.840
I have a request...!

00:03:50.840 --> 00:03:55.830
--Oh? What's that?
--Give Django wings.

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:02.110
We appreciate your assistance.

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:04.840
A private jet engine
and a load of ammo...

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:07.110
You startin' a war or something?

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:11.180
No, just chastising the
emperor in his new clothes.

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:14.790
Ah, so that's what this is about...

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:17.480
Alright! Bring the trailer in!

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:27.870
Leo-<i>ojichan</i>. Are you really
putting wings on it?

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:31.430
--Do you think I can?
--No.

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:39.980
Mommy... Why isn't Daddy getting up?

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:42.810
Mommy...!

00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:48.750
Listen, Miri. Daddy won't
be getting up anymore...

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:53.360
--He's sleeping forever...
--No!

00:04:53.360 --> 00:05:00.260
Katsu-<i>ojichan</i> gave me lotsa toys!
I wanted to show Daddy!

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:04.230
Daddy! Wake up! Come on, Daddy!

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:07.530
Miri! Don't be unreasonable!

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:15.110
--Boss...
--Yes?

00:05:15.110 --> 00:05:19.380
Did my husband protect
the town bravely?

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:23.410
Naniwa's justice will never die...!

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:31.920
Yeah... He did...

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:37.560
That's good...! He protected it!

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:53.080
I'm sorry, Mom...

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:05.500
Jo, was it?

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:09.770
Now you've done it;
now Osaka's symbol is ruined.

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:11.640
You gonna arrest me again?

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:18.410
No. But I'll skip the awkward talk
and thank you in advance

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:24.110
for trying to protect Masa-<i>yan</i>...

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:29.120
I will avenge him.
I'll make that scum Iriki pay!

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:32.620
And I'll get the guy in that robot too!

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:36.730
--There's no one in there.
--What do you mean?

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:39.460
You know that monster
that escaped underground?

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:45.470
Its brain is inside that cybot.
That's what's controlling it.

00:06:45.470 --> 00:06:47.300
Is that even possible...?

00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:52.980
Yeah? Alright, I'll be right there.

00:06:52.980 --> 00:06:54.650
Jo...!

00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:59.950
The Kanbaku Hawk will repay
her debt! Don't forget it!

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:16.530
<i>It's that again</i>...

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:20.670
A beautiful shining brain,
don't you agree?

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:23.710
Do you know how much just
one of them costs to make?

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:27.880
Of course I don't, you pervert!

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:31.210
As long as that brain is
in there, it'll never lose

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:33.950
to Bailan's snow-white doll!

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:37.450
A good emperor mustn't cause suffering.

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:41.460
I'll have to crush this entire town
in one swoop to cultivate it!

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:44.900
And I have a huge tiller at my disposal!

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:50.330
They were ecstatic when I said
I obtained a smart brain!

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:53.400
Ow...!

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:58.480
Next week, I'm getting
an upgraded tiller!

00:07:58.480 --> 00:08:01.780
Whadya say? Wanna be part of it?

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:06.510
No, no, no! I don't wanna be a tiller!

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:14.760
We can't cancel tomorrow's festival,
no matter what!

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:18.430
If we do, Osaka's spirit will vanish!

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:21.670
Unless we somehow find
that robot's hiding place,

00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:23.830
we have no chance of winning!

00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:27.940
Do whatever it takes to get
whatever info you can get!

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:31.810
It <i>has</i> to be hiding
somewhere in this town!

00:08:31.810 --> 00:08:36.650
Leave it to me, Boss! If it's that huge,
I can find it, no sweat!

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:40.950
'Cuz you're good at finding
your men whenever they run away!

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:43.450
Listen! This is a war!

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:47.360
The greatest battle since Kanbaku began!

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:51.790
We must protect this town!

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:03.000
Please continue without
stopping at intersections!

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:18.920
That house was damaged!

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:24.160
It gets damaged every year.
But they've never complained even once.

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:27.930
Huh? Where did Tetsuzo-<i>san</i> go?

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:32.200
--Wait! <i>The</i> Tetsuzo?!
--Yeah, we're acquaintances...

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:35.270
Take my advice! Get back to Tokyo now!

00:09:35.270 --> 00:09:37.800
Someday you'll get
sent flying to the moon!

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:42.510
All those festival floats!

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:45.950
Shaddup. I wanna see 'em too, ya know!

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:51.050
--A quick look wouldn't hurt, would it?
--Yeah. Wanna check 'em out?

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:57.960
Boss!

00:09:57.960 --> 00:09:59.520
From the ocean?!

00:10:00.460 --> 00:10:01.900
What the...?

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:11.310
That house just got demolished...!

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:14.740
Yikes. Might actually get
some complaints this year...

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:20.980
To the devil with you!

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:32.760
--It's Tetsuzo!
--Yeah! It's Tecchan!

00:10:32.760 --> 00:10:36.200
--Tecchan's here!
--Please! Send that thing flyin'!

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:41.440
Alright, giant robot! I'm gonna
stuff a rocket up your ass

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:44.880
and send you flying to the Grand Canyon!

00:10:44.880 --> 00:10:46.310
The Grand Canyon?!

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:50.870
Yeah, Tecchan swears the
Grand Canyon is in Hiroshima...

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:12.770
"What is Osaka's fate?"

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:16.640
"What is Osaka's fate?"
A RAPT mobile unit has
been dispatched from Tokyo

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:20.080
to put an end to the series of
terrorist incidents in Osaka.

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:22.650
The large unit is en route via the
temporarily-closed Mega Highway.

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:26.150
It is expected to arrive at 6 pm,
some four hours from now.

00:11:26.150 --> 00:11:30.150
Damn, this sucks. We givin' up already?

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:34.390
But we lack the firepower,
and there's no way to find that thing

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:37.390
if it can hide in the sky or ocean...!

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:42.930
Oh, Captain! Looks like we're
getting lots of company from Tokyo.

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:46.000
What should we do?

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:49.540
Hell if I know...!

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:50.730
Captain...!

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:55.850
<i>What should we do?</i>

00:11:55.850 --> 00:11:59.510
<i>Are we unable to protect
this town by ourselves?</i>

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:04.190
Takane here.

00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:09.030
--Dad?
--Takane! There's no time; just listen!

00:12:09.030 --> 00:12:10.460
Right!

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:13.530
The Hanshin Police has lost its way...

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:17.570
It's gotten so lost that
it's going in circles now!

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:21.370
At times like this, you should
return to where you started!

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:22.970
Where you started?

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:26.880
Yes! Return to where
the incidents began!

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:27.910
"'Search the scene 100 times."
Search the scene 100 times.
That is the heart of all investigations!

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:31.140
Search the scene 100 times.
That is the heart of all investigations!

00:12:37.090 --> 00:12:43.620
Its brain is inside that cybot.
That's what's controlling it.

00:12:54.070 --> 00:12:55.630
That's...!

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:04.010
Damn...! It pulled a fast one on us!

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:07.780
It took off once everyone was gone!

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:13.560
This is Takane! Send the science
squad to Dai-Osaka Station ASAP!

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:16.920
Figure out where exactly
the monster lost its brain!

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:23.300
That was great! The tourists this
year really got their money's worth!

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:26.600
You're a detective!
Aren't you ashamed of yourself?!

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:30.970
Don't give me lines
that I've heard before!

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:35.600
All boys would rather be
emperors than detectives!

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:43.040
Anyway, this mouth is a little
rude toward its emperor!

00:13:44.150 --> 00:13:45.990
Damn brat!

00:13:45.990 --> 00:13:50.320
You think I'll let you off easy
just 'cause you're a kid?!

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:54.260
--Come on!
--Ow...!

00:13:54.260 --> 00:13:58.760
--Let's try breaking a couple limbs!
--I'm gonna fall!

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:03.210
--I fell!
--No, you didn't!

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:06.610
--Oh. Hi.
--Iriki!

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:09.850
Aww, I had hoped to play
hide-and-seek a little longer,

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:14.450
but you found me sooner
than I expected. Well done.

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:19.160
Shut up! Now it's time for you to pay!

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:23.390
Huh? Pay? You must be
out of your mind, kiddo!

00:14:23.390 --> 00:14:29.230
It's the emperor who decides
who will pay or not! And that's me!

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:31.900
The emperor has decided!

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:37.000
He will now go and personally
crush your fortress!

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:42.480
Fools!

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:45.810
Go home and drink
your mixed juice, kids!

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:49.410
--It's a giant robot!
--Help...!

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:54.960
--No way...!
--Not again!

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:01.130
Hurry back to Jo!

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:04.230
And tell her I paid back my debt!

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:09.410
--She said she paid back her debt?
--Yeah.

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:11.740
And he said he was going
to crush their fortress?

00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:12.710
Yeah.

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:15.450
--Sei! Let's go!
--But of course!

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:18.540
Be sure to pay him back
<i>and</i> give him a souvenir.

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:23.180
Whatever. At least I can go all out now!

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:29.960
Until the sun sets...

00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:32.730
...put your life in the
hands of the Kanbaku Hawk!

00:15:32.730 --> 00:15:34.290
Fire!

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:38.900
Listen, you! Don't underestimate
the Minami homosexuals!

00:15:38.900 --> 00:15:41.800
There's no beating us
once we're really angry!

00:15:41.800 --> 00:15:46.310
I use pans so thick that they
stop bullets! Come have a bite!

00:15:46.310 --> 00:15:49.540
Don't take frozen tuna heads lightly!

00:15:55.590 --> 00:15:59.690
Sieges have been our specialty
since the Summer Siege of Osaka!

00:15:59.690 --> 00:16:01.520
We can't give up!

00:16:02.990 --> 00:16:06.390
Here goes! I dub this,
'Operation Angel Wings'!

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:21.940
Playtime's over!

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:28.590
Impudent garbage!

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:32.660
And not just you!
This entire town is a trash heap!

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:35.120
The whole place reeks of old hags!

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:38.920
I'll clean out all the trash and
turn it back into beautiful land!

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:47.630
Now it's your turn to die!

00:16:50.470 --> 00:16:51.980
Listen up, loser robot!

00:16:51.980 --> 00:16:55.250
If you wanna kill our boss,
you'll have to come through me first!

00:16:55.250 --> 00:16:59.920
--Yeah! We won't let her die!
--I don't want her to die!

00:16:59.920 --> 00:17:04.490
How beautiful! Is this the
'friendship' of her fellow scum?

00:17:04.490 --> 00:17:08.120
--I guess I'll kill you all together!
--<i>You're</i> the one who's dying!

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:10.220
What the...?!

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:19.430
Watch it, you moron!

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:23.900
--An acquaintance of yours?
--Help from the east!

00:17:36.220 --> 00:17:38.290
Huh? You already got 'em all?

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:39.560
The end!

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:42.750
--Whoa...
--Awesome!

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:03.700
Talk about reckless!

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:18.590
That's enough Air Tag!

00:18:18.590 --> 00:18:22.100
I'll scrap you and
dump you into this ditch!

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:26.360
No! Not into this nasty river!
...Just kidding!

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:33.030
Whoa!

00:18:34.510 --> 00:18:37.880
--One arm to go!
--Ha!

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:39.950
Enough of your sleep-talk!

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:43.750
You're the one who's going
to wind up as Dotonbori sludge!

00:18:52.760 --> 00:18:53.730
What the...?!

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:59.440
What are you doing to
Osaka's famous things?!

00:18:59.440 --> 00:19:03.270
<i>You're</i> the one who went
around destroying them all!

00:19:09.110 --> 00:19:10.370
That's it!

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:19.890
Here's my thanks for the hard time!

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:24.050
I'm gonna rip your head off
and stick it on top of Osaka Castle!

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:29.500
You're pathetic, Tokyo!

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:33.200
Lose to him and there'll
be no crossing the Hakone Wall!

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:36.610
Stay away! You can't
fight him on a bike!

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:40.140
Don't underestimate the Kanbaku Hawk!

00:19:40.140 --> 00:19:43.600
This time I'll warn you
that I'm jumping over you!

00:19:46.420 --> 00:19:48.890
These are Masa-<i>yan</i>'s last words!

00:19:48.890 --> 00:19:52.580
'Naniwa's justice will never die...!'

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:08.530
--Did we get him?!
--Yeah, we got 'im!

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:16.510
Jump!

00:20:34.530 --> 00:20:35.900
See you later.

00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:38.470
There's no later.
I'm never coming back.

00:20:38.470 --> 00:20:41.600
Then I'll go to the east!

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:44.940
Come on, we're taking off! It's time!

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:47.430
Bye-bye, hawk lady!

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:51.180
Seems like lotsa fun...!

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:56.580
--Stay away. It'll get
even noisier in Tokyo.
--Sounds all the more fun!

00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:15.500
Well done, Takane.

00:21:19.980 --> 00:21:24.150
I'm sorry. I wasn't able
to visit Mom's grave...

00:21:24.150 --> 00:21:29.410
You needn't say anything.
You did well. Very well.

00:21:56.890 --> 00:22:04.570
I remained motionless within the crowd

00:22:04.570 --> 00:22:12.210
Not even the voice of my
tears carried on this street

00:22:12.210 --> 00:22:19.910
as my feelings of lonesomeness joined it

00:22:19.910 --> 00:22:29.290
In truth, everyone wants
to smile with each other,

00:22:29.290 --> 00:22:35.830
yet they get hurt
when they can't do it very well

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:44.840
But someone will always
be there to watch,

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:51.750
so let's walk together
beneath this sky

